{
  "meta": {
    "description": "Receives Lection scheduled-scrape webhooks and upserts each row into Google Sheets keyed on a unique column.",
    "templateCredsSetupCompleted": false
  },
  "name": "Lection scrape to Google Sheets (dedupe on unique column)",
  "tags": [],
  "nodes": [
    {
      "id": "ec1006ea-e9e4-4309-a6ba-ae54b2c66674",
      "name": "Setup notes",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "position": [
        0,
        -260
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "color": 4,
        "width": 620,
        "height": 300,
        "content": "## Lection to Google Sheets (dedupe)\n1. Create a Google Sheet with a header row. Column names must match the scraped column names exactly.\n2. In this workflow, set the **Sheet ID** in the *Append or update rows* node and the **unique column** in its *Matching columns* field.\n3. Set `REPLACE_WITH_LECTION_SECRET` in the *Secret matches?* node to the same value you enter as the webhook secret in Lection (or delete that node if you do not use a secret).\n4. Activate the workflow, then copy the production webhook URL into Lection."
      },
      "typeVersion": 1
    },
    {
      "id": "7f24d19e-f64f-464e-8400-8ed690caf908",
      "name": "Lection schedule note",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "position": [
        0,
        60
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "color": 5,
        "width": 620,
        "height": 150,
        "content": "### In Lection\nScheduled scrape \u2192 Delivery channel: **Webhook** \u2192 paste this workflow's production URL. Optional: set the same secret.\nTest sends (`scheduled_scrape.test`) are acknowledged but NOT written, so sample rows never land in your sheet. Use a real run (Run now) to test."
      },
      "typeVersion": 1
    },
    {
      "id": "bddfb2d7-b2e3-4308-a9e3-35fc2e4f8ffc",
      "name": "Lection webhook",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.webhook",
      "position": [
        0,
        300
      ],
      "webhookId": "9d329dfc-1be9-4ec1-b446-0a4ba737defc",
      "parameters": {
        "path": "REPLACE-ME-lection-path",
        "options": {},
        "httpMethod": "POST",
        "responseMode": "responseNode"
      },
      "typeVersion": 2
    },
    {
      "id": "89d59154-fc91-4d50-992a-13baaf455831",
      "name": "Secret matches?",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.if",
      "position": [
        240,
        300
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "options": {},
        "conditions": {
          "options": {
            "version": 2,
            "leftValue": "",
            "caseSensitive": true,
            "typeValidation": "strict"
          },
          "combinator": "and",
          "conditions": [
            {
              "id": "6d8c2692-c7df-4e31-a7bf-f7e91f161c0b",
              "operator": {
                "type": "string",
                "operation": "equals"
              },
              "leftValue": "={{ $json.headers['x-lection-secret'] }}",
              "rightValue": "REPLACE_WITH_LECTION_SECRET"
            }
          ]
        }
      },
      "typeVersion": 2
    },
    {
      "id": "d172aff5-debf-4bf7-94f0-87e8a8c15c64",
      "name": "Respond 401",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.respondToWebhook",
      "position": [
        480,
        480
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "options": {
          "responseCode": 401
        },
        "respondWith": "text",
        "responseBody": "Unauthorized"
      },
      "typeVersion": 1.1
    },
    {
      "id": "5b83fa88-96e4-45f1-b70a-42c3bbab49db",
      "name": "Completed run with rows?",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.if",
      "position": [
        480,
        300
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "options": {},
